 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"AP Automation Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is accounts payable automation?\", \"a\": \"Accounts payable automation, or AP automation, is software that takes supplier invoices from receipt to payment. It reads each invoice and checks it against the purchase order. Once a bill is approved, it is paid in a scheduled run and posted to the ledger.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you set up automated accounts payable?\", \"a\": \"Automate in the order money moves: intake, matching, approvals, the ledger, then payments. Each stage depends on clean data from the one before. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a> builds all five from one description. Switch on outgoing payments last: until then, approved bills post to the ledger while the old process still pays them.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best software for accounts payable automation?\", \"a\": \"The best AP automation software depends on who you pay. Tipalti is built for paying suppliers in many countries and currencies. Basware pairs AP automation with a network for sending and receiving e-invoices. Stampli keeps approvers' questions on the invoice, with an AI assistant. Building your own fits when your approval chain would need workarounds in a suite.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the best tools for automating accounts payable?\", \"a\": \"The best tools cover the stage where your team loses the most hours. For most teams that is capture and matching: a tool that reads each PDF, finds the PO and receiving record, and holds a bill only when a line is off. Approval routing and the ledger sync come next, and payment tools last.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does accounts payable invoice automation work?\", \"a\": \"AP invoice automation turns each PDF into a bill record before anyone is asked to approve it. That record is first checked against the vendor's past bills, and a repeated invoice number, or the same amount on the same date, is flagged as a possible duplicate. For capture on its own, see <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/invoice-automation'>invoice automation</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the benefits of automated accounts payable?\", \"a\": \"With automated accounts payable, finance can see every open bill, who is holding it, and when it falls due, in one list. Next week's cash forecast becomes a lookup instead of a spreadsheet. Every approval also carries a name and a timestamp an auditor can check.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does automated AP software work with your accounting system?\", \"a\": \"Yes, if the accounting system has an API. Automated AP software built with Emergent connects to QuickBooks, Xero, or NetSuite that way. In NetSuite, for example, an approved invoice becomes a vendor bill linked to its purchase order, with the subsidiary and department set by your rules. To automate the wider close, see accounting automation.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do accounts payable automation solutions cost?\", \"a\": \"Pricing follows each vendor's model. Tipalti charges a platform fee plus per-invoice and payment fees, and the table above shows how Basware and Stampli price. Emergent runs on credits and is free to start.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is AP workflow automation the same as approval routing?\", \"a\": \"No. Approval routing answers one question: who signs off on this bill. AP workflow automation also decides whether the bill matches its PO and when the money leaves. If sign-off is all you need, start with an approval workflow.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I compare AP automation companies?\", \"a\": \"Ask AP automation companies to demo your own approval chain, with its real limits and exceptions, instead of their sample data. Then ask what leaves with you if you switch: the invoice history, and whether the rules come out in a form another system can use. An app built with Emergent exports as full code to your GitHub repository on paid plans.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
